# ── Android signing material — NEVER commit ──
# This repository is PUBLIC. PWABuilder ships signing-key-info.txt containing the
# key password, store password and alias in PLAINTEXT, next to the keystore itself.
# Committing either would hand anyone the ability to sign builds as this app.
*.keystore
*.jks
signing-key-info.txt
signing.keystore
keystore.properties

# ── Firebase service account credentials — NEVER commit ──
# The Admin SDK service account key bypasses every Firestore security rule and
# grants full read/write over all user data. It is not the same thing as the
# public web config (firebaseConfig), which is safe to commit by design.
serviceAccount*.json
*-firebase-adminsdk-*.json
.firebaserc.local
firebase-debug.log

# ── Local env ──
.env
.env.local

# ── OS / editor noise ──
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
